<title>JAPAN: FREESTYLE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEN'S COMBINED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FREESTYLE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEN'S COMBINED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NAGANO, Japan 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results of the men's</p>
<p>combined event at the world freestyle skiing championships on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>  1. Darcy Downs (Canada)	     30 points (ballet 10 points,</p>
<p>     moguls 10 points, aerials 10 points)</p>
<p>  2. Toben Sutherland (Canada)	27.60 (9.47/9.28/8.85)</p>
<p>  3. Oleg Kouleshov (Belarus)	 24.00 (6.44/8.76/8.80)</p>
<p>  4. Ondrej Vokaty (Czech Republic) 22.90 (7.94/9.35/5.61)</p>
</text>
